<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">Researchers at Ohio State, Vision Zero Columbus, and The Saunders PR Group are interested in getting feedback on Columbus road users’ opinions about Columbus road safety and safety messages.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">Your responses will be key in shaping Columbus Vision Zero’s approach to improving road safety in Columbus.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">The survey will take 10-15 minutes and you can enter for a drawing for a $5-40 Amazon gift card. The survey closes on December 23, so take it today.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">You can email the lead researcher, Brittany Shoots-Reinhard (<a id="LPlnk488458" href="mailto:shoots-reinhard.1@osu.edu" target="_blank" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="0" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">shoots-reinhard.1@osu.edu</a>) with any questions or concerns.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><em> You must complete the survey to be eligible.</em></p>
